86	 * Returns a redacted summary suitable for inclusion in server logs:
87	 * `{iss, aud, exp, scope, sub}` — email/name/picture claims are stripped
88	 * because the production code has them elsewhere (AuthProvider) and a
89	 * redacted summary is enough to diagnose `aud`/`iss`/`exp`/`scope` mismatches.
90	 *
91	 * `scope` is included (capped at 200 chars) because Logto issues the
92	 * granted-permissions list as a space-separated string. Without it, the
